## Sheet1 columns (exact order)
| Col | Header |
|-----|--------|
| A | Area |
| B | Issue |
| C | Screenshot (embedded image) |
| D | What is testing |
| E | Why that failed your prediction |

Row 1 = headers. Data from row 2.

## Footer (after last data row, leave one blank row)
```
Test cases tested: N
Passed: P
Failed: F
```

- Count only real test/finding rows (not decorative proof duplicates unless they are assertions).
- **Passed:** AC met, NOT_REPRO, or prediction held (incl. Kenya N/A_CONFIRMED).
- **Failed:** CONFIRMED, PARTIAL, unmet AC, failed prediction.

